{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"I found the main failure points: authenticated cart writes never pass the customer into cart creation/update, the current-cart query is unordered, the authenticated total handler turns its own 404/validation failures into 503, checkout wraps the amount-validation exception as 503, and the customer order facade drops pagination metadata. I’m patching those paths now, including ownership checks so cart IDs/codes cannot cross customer boundaries."}}
